  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mine Kafon Drone system</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The company Mine Kafon intends to make a significant contribution to limiting the landmine problem. They have developed a technically advanced drone based on multi-sensory technology. The system is equipped with advanced mapping and detection software to effectively gain insight into contaminated areas.In the demo project Mine Kafon wants to demonstrate the drone at different locations (regions) in Ukraine. The purpose of the demo is to demonstrate that the Mine Kafon Drone system can locate landmines faster, safer and cheaper than current alternatives with an emphasis on optimal functioning in agricultural areas.</narrative>
  </description>
